## Setup

```bash
git submodule update --init --recursive
bundle install
yarn install
cp config/app_config.example.yml config/app_config.yml
bin/rails db:create db:migrate db:seed
```

## Development

```bash
bin/dev
```

Runs three processes from `Procfile.dev`: the Rails server, esbuild (JS), and
dart-sass (CSS). Both output to `app/assets/builds/`, served by Propshaft.
Running `bin/rails server` alone skips asset compilation.

One-off build without watchers:

```bash
yarn build
bin/rails dartsass:build
```

## Configuration

`config/app_config.yml` → `APP_CONFIG` (loaded in `config/application.rb`).
Gitignored — commit changes to `config/app_config.example.yml` instead.

To change the color theme, edit `app_config.yml` then regenerate:

```bash
bin/rails wulin_master:generate_theme_color_css
```

## Adding a screen

```bash
bin/rails generate wulin_master:screen_and_grid Post title content:text
```

Add it to the menu in `ApplicationController.define_menu`.
